    "recommended_actions": [
      "Remediate request construction: upload the file and pass the supported uploaded file object instead of a signed URL string.",
      "Validate serialized Gmail attachment arguments before execution so shape errors are caught prior to enqueue/send attempts.",
      "After correcting argument shape, replay only the blocked cedar attachment-send operations that are still safe to retry."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Current evidence directly shows the failure mechanism on sampled requests, but does not enumerate every individual failed cedar request.",
      "No provider-side traces were needed because the observed failing request never reached Google.",
      "Historical and deployment records are weak context only and not proof of current causation."
